    "# Rakuten Multimodal Product Classification: EDA\n",
    "\n",
    "
    "(challenge: https://challengedata.ens.fr/challenges/35).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Goal:** Predict `prdtypecode` (product type) from text (designation, description) and product image. This notebook covers exploration only: schema, target distribution, text length stats, language guess, and image samples streamed from `images.zip` without extracting the 2.5 GB archive."
   ]
